/.refs/
/_refs/

# Lusion reverse-engineering raw artifacts — proprietary code, NEVER push
/research/lusion-raw/

.vercel
.env*

# motion graphics ad (Remotion project "sersan-film") — NOT part of the site
# build. It is a separate npm project with its own package.json, tsconfig and
# node_modules, and the root has no workspaces, so `bun install` on Vercel
# never installs its deps. While it was tracked AND inside the root tsconfig's
# `**/*.tsx` include, `next build` typechecked 1102 of its files against
# packages that do not exist on the build machine — the deploy died at
# "Running TypeScript" while every local build stayed green (motion/node_modules
# exists here). Excluded from tsconfig too, belt and braces.
/motion/
